# ScholarLMS support email reminder

This repo is shared between **MooPlugins** (upstream) and **ScholarLMS** (local deployment).

When making or finishing changes to `local_smartsearch`, **remind the user** to set the feedback destination for ScholarLMS before syncing to ScholarLMS:

- **ScholarLMS:** `support@scholarlms.com`
- **MooPlugins / GitHub upstream:** `support@mooplugins.com`

## Where to change it

In `classes/external/feedback_external.php`:

```php
private const FEEDBACK_EMAIL = 'support@scholarlms.com'; // ScholarLMS only
```

## When to remind

- After editing feedback, email, or external API code
- Before rsync/deploy to `/home/anup/htdocs/slmsnew/courses/public/local/smartsearch/`
- Before committing or opening a PR if feedback email was touched
- At end of session if any plugin files changed

## Deploy note

Do **not** commit the ScholarLMS email to the upstream repo unless the user explicitly asks. Keep `support@mooplugins.com` in git; apply `support@scholarlms.com` only on the ScholarLMS copy (or document both in the reminder).
